//    queues to the Phrogram orchestrator's input channel.
// 2. Synchronization: Ensure I/O channel synchronization is enabled to
//    prevent race conditions during concurrent audit processing.
// 3. Monitoring: Deploy the structured reporting module to track
//    remediation success rates and rollback frequencies.
// 4. Safety: Enable explicit buffer management flags to prevent
//    memory corruption during high-volume remediation bursts.

END_MAIN_ROUTINE
